 59wPjw1GXfzNZEWnKuNAAFA59qjA694xACCl\n\nHosted by CFS Ontario
  (https://cfsontario.ca/)\n\nJoin students across Ontario in walking out
  and demanding better rights for ALL. Students are taking a stand against
  unfair policies around OSAP cuts\, higher tuition fees\, threats to
  campus services\, and increased policing in schools. Education and campus
  spaces are under attack\, and students are fighting back Bring a friend\,
  build the movement. 
