SUMMARY:Counter-Mapping For Treaty Education - by Yellowhead Institute
LOCATION:Upper Gym\, Toronto Metropolitan University
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/De97j0DnaQZ\n\nHosted by
  Yellowhead Institute (https://yellowheadinstitute.org/)\n\nJoin
  Yellowhead Institute for a demo on the treaty map and discussion on
  treaty mapping\, counter-mapping\, and education. Despite treaties being
  among the “highest laws of the land\,” they remain deeply
  misunderstood\, mal-interpreted\, and flattened through dominating
  Canadian narratives. Counter-mapping is one tool to resist static
  interpretations of treaty. 
END:VEVENT
