SUMMARY:Edward Said: Between Worlds - by Mayworks Festival
LOCATION:87 Elm St 
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfFaK-2tVa1/\n\nHosted by Mayworks
  Festival (https://mayworks.ca)\n\nBuilt from archival material\, Edward
  Said: Between Worlds follows Said from his Jerusalem childhood to his
  passing in New York. Witnessing the Nakba of 1948—the violent\, forced
  displacement of 75% of Palestinians from their homes as part of
  Israel’s establishment—and the 1993 Oslo Accords\, the film traces
  how exile shaped his scholarship and advocacy.
END:VEVENT
