  https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8dad66aafa6100295ef816\n\nHoste
 d by Toronto Public Library (https://www.torontopubliclibrary.ca)\n\nLearn
  more about Toronto's multifaceted Indigenous history\, which has often
  been ignored or minimized due to the telling of the region's history only
  from settler perspectives. Join this event for a panel discussion about a
  public history project that worked with five local First Nations to
  create a more accurate and inclusive story of the region's past.
